1
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,159
Did you find out?

2
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,880
Nightclubs, gold chains, or luxury watches?

3
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,600
The payee is an agency.

4
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,320
And here I thought he had real ambition.

5
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,000
Got a sudden windfall,

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,120
and couldn't wait to buy a car and house, huh?

7
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:09,400
Should we freeze that card?

8
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,439
No need.

9
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,439
That pocket change means nothing to me.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,280
Consider it paying for peace and quiet.

11
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:16,400
Don't let me hear about him ever again.

12
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,680
Yes, Chairwoman Shen.

13
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,120
Satisfied, Mr. Ma?

14
00:01:22,239 --> 00:01:22,680
Looks good.

15
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:23,879
Here, Mr. Ma.

16
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,040
Mr. Ma!

17
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:28,840
As for the remaining contracts,

18
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,519
I'll wrap them all up for you this afternoon!

19
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,159
Fine.

20
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,280
Take care, Mr. Ma!

21
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:35,560
Safe travels, Mr. Ma!

22
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,280
Turn left outside, there are steps!

23
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,640
Watch your step, Mr. Ma!

24
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,799
Come to Xiao Mei for future business!

25
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:45,959
Pfft!

26
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:50,480
You just cleared out stock stuck for three years!

27
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:52,000
Enjoy losing your shirt!

28
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,079
Hick!

29
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,079
Way to go, Xiao Mei!

30
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,560
Xiao Mei rules!

31
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,599
It was nothing.

32
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:59,599
Xiao Mei's the best! Xiao Mei's the best!

33
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:02,920
Xiao Mei's the best! Xiao Mei's the best!

34
00:02:07,319 --> 00:02:08,120
Mr. Zhao!

35
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,599
You're here!

36
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,479
Mr. Zhao!

37
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:17,960
Right this way.

38
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,960
This is the Chengbei plot you were tipped off about.

39
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:20,599
Watch your step.

40
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,039
It's windy and dusty out here.

41
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,479
Take it easy.

42
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:27,439
Mr. Zhao,

43
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,680
this dump...

44
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,439
The roads are uneven and full of dust.

45
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,879
Don't get your shoes dirty!

46
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,000
Zhao Gang.

47
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,400
In my past life, he ordered Zhou Qian

48
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,840
to make me bribe that director,

49
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,479
then turned around and made me the scapegoat.

50
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:42,879
He landed me in prison for nothing,

51
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,960
destroying my family and my life.

52
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:46,080
Enough.

53
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,719
No matter how shiny your shoes are,

54
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:48,960
if you screw up the job,

55
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,840
it's all completely useless.

56
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:51,039
Right, of course.

57
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,520
This place really is a dump.

58
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,879
But it's massive.

59
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,120
Once it's demolished,

60
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:57,840
we'll make a fortune.

61
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,360
Yes.

62
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,319
Mr. Zhao,

63
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:02,400
according to our preliminary screening,

64
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:04,039
all the residents on this old street

65
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:04,960
are just ordinary folks

66
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,280
with zero backing.

67
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:08,719
As long as we apply a little pressure,

68
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,439
the demolition will finish right on schedule.

69
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:12,800
Who's this?

70
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,280
Mr. Zhao,

71
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,800
she just transferred over from our group—

72
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:17,759
Hello, Mr. Zhao.

73
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,159
My name is Zhou Qian.

74
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:20,879
I'm currently in charge of our group's

75
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,159
investigation here in Chengbei.

76
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,280
I look forward to your guidance, Mr. Zhao.

77
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,120
Young lady,

78
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,240
you're quite ambitious, aren't you?

79
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,840
Learn to be more accommodating.

80
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,639
As long as you're obedient and know the rules,

81
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:42,759
and work hard at the company,

82
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,199
whatever you want,

83
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,759
the company can provide.

84
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,319
Mr. Zh—

85
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:50,120
You flatter her, Mr. Zhao.

86
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:52,319
Qianqian knows how to behave.

87
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:55,479
Please give her guidance in the future,

88
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:56,800
and look out for her.

89
00:04:05,199 --> 00:04:05,879
Chairwoman Shen!

90
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:07,599
Chairwoman Shen!

91
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:09,199
Why are you calling me in person?

92
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,080
I'm right here in Chengbei,

93
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,639
keeping an eye on the demolition plot for you.

94
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,199
Don't you worry.

95
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,439
Just say the word, Yunding Group,

96
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,920
and Zhao's Construction

97
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,519
will be your foot soldier.

98
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:24,759
Alright!

99
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,920
Rest assured.

100
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:26,920
With me on it,

101
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:27,600
this plot of land

102
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,480
will be cleared out perfectly for you.

103
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,160
Yes, of course, Chairwoman Shen.

104
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,079
Right, right.

105
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,240
Just give the word anytime.

106
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,879
Yes, goodbye, goodbye.

107
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:39,519
Mr. Zhao,

108
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,360
let's go.

109
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,560
Let's inspect the land!

110
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,360
Yunding...

111
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,759
Chairwoman Shen...

112
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,240
That's right!

113
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:51,120
In my past life, Zhao Gang's biggest backer

114
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,839
was the chairwoman of Yunding Group,

115
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:53,959
Shen Jialing!

116
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:56,079
Zhao Gang rushed over here

117
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:59,079
to cash in on the Chengbei demolition, too.

118
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:01,199
Too bad.

119
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:03,759
In this life, the chips you need to enter the game

120
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,199
have already been snatched by me.

121
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,040
Sister-in-law!

122
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,839
Is Ma Dawei home?

123
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:12,759
Nannan!

124
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,879
Come on in and sit down.

125
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,160
Dawei will be back shortly.

126
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:17,360
What do you need him for?

127
00:05:26,839 --> 00:05:28,519
Didn't you say we'd act like strangers if we met?

128
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:30,199
Why did you come running to my place then?

129
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,800
If my dad hadn't forced me to make this trip,

130
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,199
I wouldn't even set foot near your alley!

131
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:39,360
Here's the sample my dad made

132
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,759
overnight based on your design.

133
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,399
I really don't get it.

134
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,079
What kind of spell did you cast on him?

135
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:44,800
He's been

136
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,120
a factory director for over 30 years,

137
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,920
yet he actually believes this indecent outfit

138
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,160
can make money for the factory

139
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,720
and bring it back from the dead!

140
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,120
Dad.

141
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,040
Uncle Ma.

142
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:56,560
This...

143
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,519
This neckline plunges almost to the navel!

144
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:00,600
Ridiculous!

145
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:02,040
Clothes this scandalous...

146
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,160
Wearing this outside will make people think

147
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,319
you're not a decent person!

148
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,800
Why do you always give people bad ideas?

149
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:09,240
See? I told you no one could wear this out!

150
00:06:09,639 --> 00:06:11,319
My dad was just so desperate

151
00:06:11,319 --> 00:06:12,639
that he bought into your nonsense!

152
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,480
Whether it works or not,

153
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,680
you'll only know once you try it.

154
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,560
Just looking at it is useless.

155
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,800
We have to see how it fits.

156
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,560
You.

157
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,839
Go put it on and try it.

158
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,040
Me?

159
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,319
In your dreams, you pervert!

160
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:26,680
I'd never wear such shameless clothes!

161
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:29,240
It just uses a little less fabric.

162
00:06:29,399 --> 00:06:30,639
Look how well it cinches the waist!

163
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,319
If she won't try it,

164
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,199
Sister-in-law will try it on for you!

165
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,639
Sounds great, Sister-in-law!

166
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,040
You'll look absolutely stylish in it!

167
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,319
Nannan,

168
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:53,800
is your dad doing okay?

169
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:54,839
He's doing great.

170
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,959
Uncle, how about you?

171
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,160
Same as usual.

172
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,040
Last time, I asked your dad

173
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,680
to find him an odd job.

174
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,639
How did he end up designing clothes?

175
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,959
Who knows?

176
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:05,879
Ask him.

177
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,959
Talent. A natural gift.

178
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,040
Runs in the family.

179
00:07:13,319 --> 00:07:14,240
Don't let it go to your head.

180
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:14,879
I'm telling you,

181
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,439
I took a couple of your melon seeds,

182
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,480
and you're being such a cheapskate!

183
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:41,439
What do you think?

184
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,639
I knew once Sister-in-law put this on,

185
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:01,360
she'd look like a superstar from Hong Kong, China!

186
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,759
Not bad at all.

187
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,480
I told you the clothes Dawei designed

188
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,439
would definitely turn out great.

189
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,399
Dawei,

190
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:08,600
should I wear this tie or not?

191
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,480
Leave it off.

192
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:13,839
So, what do you think?

193
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,639
Does this indecent outfit meet your approval?

194
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,519
Barely passable.

195
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:21,839
Alright.

196
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,399
Tell Uncle Dong when you get back

197
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:25,040
that the cut and fabric are all good,

198
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:26,279
and mass production can begin.

199
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:28,079
As for the next batch of designs,

200
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,160
I'll give them to him in a few days.

201
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,240
Don't celebrate too early.

202
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,519
If this batch doesn't sell,

203
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:35,759
you'll take full responsibility.

204
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,480
I gotta say,

205
00:08:58,159 --> 00:09:00,360
the cut really flatters the figure.

206
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:01,799
That guy Ma Dawei...

207
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,440
actually knows women pretty well.

208
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,399
Based on your measurements,

209
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,639
the neckline needs to be raised two centimeters.

210
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:12,360
Otherwise, you're too small...

211
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:13,480
to fill it out.

212
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:18,559
Ma Dawei!

213
00:09:18,559 --> 00:09:19,559
You pervert!

214
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,600
You're the one who's small!

215
00:09:22,799 --> 00:09:24,080
Just wait, it's gonna be a huge hit.

216
00:09:28,279 --> 00:09:29,039
Next up,

217
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:32,399
we can only scale up sales by getting into major malls.

218
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,440
Yunding Department Store is the biggest mall in town,

219
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:37,279
and it's a nationwide chain.

220
00:09:37,919 --> 00:09:41,240
The redevelopment of Chengbei Old Street is also under Yunding.

221
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,200
Looks like

222
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:46,799
it's time to meet

223
00:09:46,799 --> 00:09:49,200
that legendary female tycoon.

224
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,240
What do you think you're doing?

225
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,039
You little punk.

226
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,440
You think you belong here?

227
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:05,879
Think us guards are just for show?

228
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:06,720
Get lost! Move along!

229
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:10,000
With my class, do I look like a punk?

230
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,919
I'm here to see your boss.

231
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,039
See our boss?

232
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:15,759
You think Yunding Group is a flea market

233
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:17,000
that anyone can just walk into?

234
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:18,840
You want to see Chairwoman Shen?

235
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,759
Take a look in the mirror

236
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,679
and see if you're worthy!

237
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:23,559
Get lost! Scram!

238
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,159
Don't push!

239
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:24,840
Move it! Out!

240
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:28,679
Don't "hey" me, move it!

241
00:10:28,799 --> 00:10:29,639
That drunk rich woman...
